@startuml
title CON-SD-D13 Continuity Observability and Audit Event Flow
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "Central PMS\ncontinuity decisions" as Central
component "Connector health /\nprojection freshness" as Connector
component "Continuity Terminal\nrestricted activity" as CT
component "POS fiscal outcomes" as POS
component "Payment outcomes" as Pay
component "Gate / manual release outcomes" as Gate
component "Operator Console\ngovernance actions" as OC
component "Audit / Event capability" as Audit
component "Management Dashboard\nvisibility only" as Dash
component "Reconciliation consumers" as Recon

Central --> Audit
Connector --> Audit
CT --> Audit
POS --> Audit
Pay --> Audit
Gate --> Audit
OC --> Audit
Audit --> Dash : source/freshness/authority labels
Audit --> Recon : review and closure inputs

note bottom
Audit, events, dashboards, and reports communicate facts.
They do not transfer authority or close reconciliation by themselves.
end note
@enduml
